# NutriX API: sample requests.
# Use with the VS Code "REST Client" extension (click "Send Request"), or import into Postman / Insomnia.
# 1) Set @host, 2) run "login", 3) the token is captured into {{token}} for every request below.

@host = http://localhost:8000
@email = dev@nutrix.dev
@password = nutrix123

### Health of every service (public)
GET {{host}}/health/all

### Login (public). The token is stored for the requests below
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Register a new account (public)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "newuser@example.com", "password": "secret123", "name": "New User",
  "age": 28, "gender": "female", "height": 165, "weight": 60, "activity_level": "lightly_active", "goal": "maintenance" }

### Current user (profile, targets, is_onboarded)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Save onboarding / profile (email must be the caller's)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "name": "Dev User", "age": 30, "gender": "male", "height": 175, "weight": 72,
  "activity_level": "moderately_active", "goal": "maintenance",
  "preferences": [ { "preference_type": "diet_type", "value": "Vegetarian" } ] }

### Dashboard: today's totals vs targets
GET {{host}}/api/v1/user/daily-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Meal diary (last 7 days, paginated)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/user/history?page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Live dashboard stream (Server-Sent Events). Stays open: use curl -N or a streaming client
GET {{host}}/api/v1/user/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Log a meal
POST {{host}}/api/v1/meal-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "user_id": 1, "food_name": "Banana", "meal_type": "Snack", "calories": 105, "protein": 1.3,
  "carbs": 27, "fat": 0.4, "weight_g": 118, "source": "manual" }

### Delete a meal log (use an id from the response above)
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/meal-logs/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Water and weight
POST {{host}}/api/v1/water-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "user_id": 1, "amount_ml": 250 }

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/water-logs/today/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{host}}/api/v1/weight-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "user_id": 1, "weight": 71.5 }

### Fast food
GET {{host}}/api/v1/fast-food/chains
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/fast-food/grouped?brand=dominos&diet_filter=Vegetarian
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Recipes
GET {{host}}/api/v1/recipes/top?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/recipes/search?q=dal&max_results=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{host}}/api/v1/recipes/recommend
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ingredients": ["paneer", "tomato", "onion"], "top_n": 5 }

### Meal plan (4 slots, optimised to the user's targets)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/meal-plans/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "user_id": 1, "preference": "balanced", "tolerance": 0.2 }

### Barcode by number
GET {{host}}/api/v1/barcode/8901058852712
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Barcode from a photo (multipart). Replace the path with a real image
POST {{host}}/api/v1/barcode/scan-image
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----nutrix

------nutrix
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="barcode.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./barcode.jpg
------nutrix
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="diet_type"

Vegetarian
------nutrix--

### Nutrition-facts label from a photo (multipart)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/ocr/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----nutrix

------nutrix
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="label.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./label.jpg
------nutrix--

### AI coach (the reply has source: gemini | local | offline)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/ai/coach
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "Suggest a high-protein vegetarian snack", "history": [] }

### Homely meal calculator
POST {{host}}/api/v1/homely-meals/calculate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ingredients": [ { "ingredient_name": "paneer", "amount": 100, "unit": "g" } ] }
